v><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-md mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Soal Matematika</label><textarea rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Ketik atau tempel soal di sini. Contoh:  Sebuah kolam renang berbentuk balok dengan panjang 25 m, lebar 10 m, dan kedalaman 2 m. Berapa volume air yang dibutuhkan untuk mengisi penuh kolam tersebut?\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all resize-none disabled:opacity-50\"></textarea><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">💡 Tuliskan soal selengkap mungkin — sertakan semua angka dan satuan yang diketahui.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container border border-slate-100\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px] mt-0.5 shrink-0\">psychology</span><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Tool ini menggunakan <strong class=\"text-on-surface\">AI Reasoning khusus matematika</strong> — lebih akurat untuk soal cerita, aljabar, dan geometri.</p></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-sm disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">calculate</span><span>Jelaskan Langkah-langkahnya</span></button></form><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Panduan &amp; FAQ: Penjelas Soal Matematika</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Pertanyaan seputar cara menggunakan AI untuk memahami langkah pengerjaan soal matematika.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Jenis soal matematika apa saja yang bisa dijelaskan?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Tool ini bisa menjelaskan hampir semua jenis soal matematika SD hingga SMA, termasuk: <strong>soal cerita</strong> (volume, luas, jarak-waktu-kecepatan), <strong>aljabar</strong> (persamaan linear, kuadrat, sistem persamaan), <strong>geometri</strong> (bangun datar dan ruang), <strong>statistika</strong> (rata-rata, median, modus), <strong>trigonometri</strong>, dan <strong>matriks</strong>. Sertakan semua angka dan konteks dalam soal agar penjelasan lebih akurat.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Kenapa AI membutuhkan waktu lebih lama dari tools lain?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Tool ini menggunakan <strong>AI model reasoning khusus</strong> yang dirancang untuk berpikir langkah demi langkah sebelum menjawab — mirip cara guru matematika memeriksa soal sebelum menjelaskan. Proses ini membutuhkan waktu 10–30 detik, tetapi hasilnya jauh lebih akurat dan terstruktur dibanding model AI biasa.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah penjelasan ini bisa digunakan untuk memahami, bukan sekadar menyalin jawaban?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Inilah tujuan utama TugasMu. Setiap penjelasan mencakup: (1) apa yang diketahui, (2) apa yang ditanya, (3) rumus yang digunakan beserta penjelasan konsepnya, (4) langkah perhitungan bertahap, dan (5) tips agar tidak salah di soal serupa. Pahami konsepnya dulu — baru kerjakan sendiri soal latihan berikutnya.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Bisakah soal dengan foto atau gambar dikirim ke tool ini?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Saat ini tool hanya menerima <strong>input teks</strong>. Jika soalmu berupa foto, ketik ulang teks soalnya secara lengkap termasuk semua angka dan keterangan gambar. Fitur input foto (OCR) sedang dalam pengembangan untuk versi berikutnya.</p></div></div></details></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.com</span></div><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 TugasMu.com. Hak cipta dilindungi.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-sl